<title>PERU: Milpo sets 0.14 sol dividend per shr.</title>
<headline>Milpo sets 0.14 sol dividend per shr.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polymetallic Peruvian mining company Milpo approved a cash dividend of 0.14 sol per common and labour share based on 1996 results, the Lima Stock Exchange said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The exchange said in its daily report that the record date is May 8 and the payout date May 26.</p>
<p>Holders of common shares, totalling 1.77 million, and of labour shares, totalling 862,423, will benefit from the dividend payment.</p>
<p>((-- Paul de Bendern, Lima newsroom 511 221-2134))</p>
